TaxiNow third-party data notices
================================

OpenStreetMap
-------------

The bundled tests/fixtures/airport-maps/CYYZ.v2.json regression asset contains
data derived from OpenStreetMap.

© OpenStreetMap contributors
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

OpenStreetMap data is made available under the Open Data Commons Open Database
License (ODbL) 1.0. This data asset is not covered by the TaxiNow Personal
Non-Commercial License.

OurAirports
-----------

TaxiNow uses the OurAirports airport and runway CSV datasets. OurAirports
publishes its downloadable data as public domain.
https://ourairports.com/data/

X-Plane Scenery Gateway
-----------------------

When authoritative map detail is unavailable, the map downloader can obtain
taxi-route and parking-position detail from the X-Plane Scenery Gateway.
https://gateway.x-plane.com/

FAA Airport Mapping
-------------------

TaxiNow can use FAA Airport Mapping open data to supplement incomplete US
airport building, taxiway, and apron geometry where the dataset has coverage.
https://adds-faa.opendata.arcgis.com/

Geofabrik
---------

TaxiNow's maintainer map-pack workflow can use regional OpenStreetMap extracts
distributed by Geofabrik. The contained OSM data remains subject to ODbL.
https://download.geofabrik.de/

Overture Maps Foundation
------------------------

Maintainer-built map packs can optionally use Overture building footprints as
a strictly filtered supplemental source. Each published pack must retain its
applicable source attribution and license information.
https://overturemaps.org/
